WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.578
A Lingani wã sẽn be Tangare. Bãngr-gomd sẽn gomd pãn-tõog yelle.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:19.922
Gãrango, sẽn yaa tẽn-kãseng a ye pʋgẽ wã, neb nins sẽn yaa kãsm dãmb segd n tũuda b noyã. A yaa kãsem soaba, la a pa zabd ne taab ye.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.930
Zu-soaba kiime, la tẽnga fãa yãbdame. La d zoe n get-a lame.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.216
Ned pa rat n gũ ye.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.392
M pa rat ned ye.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:18.586
La a Zezi meng na n yeelg-a-la naam roogo. Kãsem-dãmbã wõgemda b ninã, n pa leok ye.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:38.852
Tãn-kãnga lʋɩɩsame n lʋɩ. A wʋka-a lame. A leb n lʋɩɩsame.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:53.146
Sa-kãseng yiime, la bõn-buudã lʋɩɩs pʋʋgẽ. Nebã zãaga b mens ne-a.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:03.968
B yetame tɩ sã n pa tar Lingãni rãmbã, b na n paama zu-soaba.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:15.168
Rẽ poore, kãsem-dãmbã na n baoo taoor soab ning b sẽn yãkã.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:24.464
B tall-a lame n kẽng Tangare.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:45.184
Tangaré yaa Lingani nebã tẽn-tẽngã.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:50.536
Ad-y ned ning sẽn watã.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:58.082
Sẽn yãk-a wã kẽnda zĩiga. Ned pa mi bũmb ning sẽn maand be ye.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:08.824
Sẽn paase, d pa na n togs nebã bũmb ning b sẽn maandã ye.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:29.106
Yaa wakat ning b sẽn na n dɩ naam wã. A Zezi naam roog n lʋɩɩ bãmb zugu, la b tõoga.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:39.736
La bilf-bilfu, saagã leb n waa tẽngã zugu.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:09.840
Baa rũndã-rũndã, b yetame tɩ ned baa a yen ka rɩt naam Garango soolmẽ n yaool n kẽng Tangare.
